    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/fae40d56-f882-4c3b-aeb2-63579aee41a1.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.58681in;height:1.42708in\" /></p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Equation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>13</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;units</p>",
